LITTLE WINDOWS V4 — AUDIO AND ART CREDITS

Downloaded cat recordings
-------------------------
None. No third-party sound recordings were downloaded or bundled.
The recording catalog was inaccessible from the development environment;
the game uses original procedural synthesis instead.

Original cat voices
-------------------
Source: src/cat-audio.ts
Meows: harmonic/glottal voice with changing vowel formants, breath,
micro-jitter and varied pitch contours, duration and mood.
Purrs: filtered breath noise, low chest resonance, separate fast purr
pulses and slower inhalation/exhalation envelopes.
Chirps: short, voiced rising/falling syllables and double chirps.
Hisses: soft, shaped, unvoiced airflow with a gradual attack.
No external sample source or recording license applies to these sounds.

Original score, city ambience, rain and care effects
--------------------------------------------------
Source: src/audio.ts
Locally generated with Web Audio; no external sample recordings.

Original pixel art and animation
-------------------------------
